    <p>Until 2006, Pluto was counted as a planet too. Then astronomers decided it is a <em>dwarf planet</em>, because it is much smaller and shares its orbit with lots of other icy objects.</p>
    <p>How many planets are there in our solar system now? Type a number.</p>
